### Activity Diagram — User Animation Workflow

The workflow shows how a user selects inputs and settings, validates them, and generates an animation.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Open Google Colab Demo]
    B --> C[Select Source Image]
    C --> D[Select Driving Video]
    D --> E[Select Model]
    E --> F[Configure Relative Movement]
    F --> G[Configure Movement Scale]
    G --> H{Inputs Valid?}
    H -- No --> I[Correct Inputs]
    I --> C
    H -- Yes --> J[Generate Animation]
    J --> K[View Generated Video]
    K --> L([End])
```